hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.draconic_projectile.name=Draconic Projectile
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.draconic_projectile.description=Unlock one projectile every 5–7 seconds after aiming for 0.4–0.7 seconds. Elemental forms deal 8 damage; Wild deals 10. Fire burns for 2 damage each second for 4 seconds; Ice slows movement by 20% for 4 seconds; Lightning blocks abilities for 0.5 seconds; Nature roots movement for 0.6 seconds; Toxic reduces outgoing damage by 10% for 5 seconds; Void increases damage taken by 10% for 5 seconds; Wild applies no status.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_range.name=Projectile Range
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_range.description=Use the Intermediate single-shot profile: 12 damage for elemental forms or 15 for Wild; launch force 34 instead of 28, air-speed cap 40 instead of 32, gravity 4 instead of 6, and lifetime 5 instead of 4 seconds. Aim time and cooldown are unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_cadence.name=Projectile Cadence
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_cadence.description=Use the Intermediate single-shot profile (12 damage for elemental forms or 15 for Wild) and reduce the projectile cooldown from 5–7 to 4–6 seconds. Aim time is unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_guidance.name=Projectile Guidance
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_guidance.description=Use the Intermediate single-shot profile (12 damage for elemental forms or 15 for Wild) and aim for 0.55–0.85 instead of 0.4–0.7 seconds for a more reliable shot. Cooldown is unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_pattern.name=Projectile Pattern
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_pattern.description=Fire two shots 0.30 seconds apart with Intermediate ballistics every 4–6 seconds. Elemental forms deal 10 + 10 damage; Wild deals 12 + 12. Only the first shot applies the form's status. Guidance still improves aim if owned.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_mastery.name=Projectile Mastery
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.projectile_mastery.description=Fire two shots 0.30 seconds apart every 3–5 seconds after aiming for 0.55–0.85 seconds. Elemental forms deal 10 + 10 damage; Wild deals 12 + 12. Only the first shot applies the form's status. Apex ballistics use launch force 40, air-speed cap 48, gravity 3, and a 6-second lifetime.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.swoop_ferocity.name=Swoop Ferocity
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.swoop_ferocity.description=Increase swoop damage from 16 to 20. Cooldown is unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.swoop_cadence.name=Swoop Cadence
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.swoop_cadence.description=Reduce swoop cooldown from 25–35 to 22–30 seconds. Damage is unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.swoop_precision.name=Swoop Precision
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.swoop_precision.description=Increase swoop approach speed from 55% to 70% of flight speed. Damage and cooldown are unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.relentless_swoop.name=Relentless Swoop
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.relentless_swoop.description=Reduce swoop cooldown from 22–30 to 20–26 seconds. Damage is unchanged.
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.rending_dive.name=Rending Dive
hydragon.talents.miniwyvern.rending_dive.description=Increase swoop damage from 20 to 24. Cooldown is unchanged.
